\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01W6}{\texttt{Stacks tag 01W6}}


Suppose given a commutative diagram of schemes
$$
\begin{array}{ccc}X \longrightarrow\searrow &  & Y \swarrow \\  & S & \end{array}
$$
